+### Switching providers
+
+`PROVIDER` in `.env` selects the backend for `/chat` and `/stream`:
+
+- `gemini` (default) — Google's Gemini API, via `GOOGLE_API_KEY`.
+- `ollama` — a local Ollama server, via its OpenAI-compatible endpoint. No key needed.
+- `kilo` — the Kilo gateway, via `KILO_API_KEY`.
+
+All three share the same tools (`tools.py`) and system prompt (`prompts.py`); only `providers/` differs per backend. See `providers/base.py` for the interface if you want to add another one.
+
